  "name": "08 - Expense Capture Telegram",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expense Capture (local demo)\n\n1. Allowlisted user sends a **photo/image file** (no /start caption needed)\n2. OpenRouter (`google/gemini-2.5-flash`) extracts fields\n3. Row appended to Sheet with `pending approval`\n4. **Inline Approve/Reject buttons** in Telegram (no browser redirect)\n5. Sheet status updated; buttons cleared + status on message\n\n`/start` \u2192 help text.\n\nCredentials: Telegram Expense Capture \u00b7 OpenRouter Expense N8N \u00b7 Google Sheets account",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
      },
